          "text": "kandi ngw Inzu yawe azoyihindura nk’iya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, kandi ngw Ayihindure nk’iya Bayasha mwene Ahiya, ngo Kubg’ umwikomo wamuteye ukamuratsa, ugakwegera Abisirayeli mu vyaha; ",
